## 30. Analytics Consistency

Analytics can be eventually consistent.

Example:

~~~text
User clicks the link now.
Redirect happens immediately.
Dashboard updates after a few seconds or minutes.
~~~

This is acceptable because:

- Redirect correctness is critical.
- Real-time reporting is less critical.
- Delayed processing improves availability.
- Workers can process events in batches.

The dashboard should show its most recent processing time.

